# Question 9
The directory `data/old_records` contains several **.txt** files. Move all files modified before 2025 to a new directory called `data/archive`.

(We have not yet covered file modification times, but try using the following hint to help).

<span style="color:#8b0153;">Hint</span>: Use `os.path.getmtime()` to get modification time of a file:
```python
import time
# Example comparison:
if time.gmtime(os.path.getmtime(filename)).tm_year < 2025:
    # Move the file
```
